          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பயனுள்ள — payaṉuḷḷa — \"useful\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பயனுள்ள (payaṉuḷḷa) is payaṉ, \"use, benefit\", with uḷḷa, \"which has\", from native uḷ, \"to be\" (DEDR 697). Payaṉ is usually connected with paya, \"to yield, to bear fruit\" (DEDR 3937), but DEDR does not list payaṉ itself."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
